# fastly_ngwaf_workspace_alert_mailing_list_integrations (Data Source)

Use this data source to retrieve `mailinglist` alert integrations scoped to a single Fastly Next-Gen WAF workspace.

## Example Usage

```terraform
data "fastly_ngwaf_workspace_alert_mailing_list_integrations" "example" {
  workspace_id = fastly_ngwaf_workspace.example.id
}

output "ngwaf_workspace_alert_mailing_list_integrations" {
  value = data.fastly_ngwaf_workspace_alert_mailing_list_integrations.example.alerts
}
```

